# UM03, after um03-usb.script (START=its end.snap): up one row to USB AUDIO/MIDI, YES: back to the stereo mode.
wait-emu 0.3
png 00-start
tap Up
wait-emu 0.3
png 01-row3
tap Return           # YES: USB AUDIO/MIDI
wait-emu 1.0
png 02-chosen
wait-emu 1.0
png 03-later
